/Author (Tri-Fusion) /CreationDate (D:20261018212233+05'00') /Creator (anonymous) /Keywords (Namma Civic; AI Builder Cup; Sustainability & Social Impact; Challenge: Build an AI-powered solution that addresses a meaningful environmental or societal challenge. Solutions may focus on improving resource efficiency, increasing accessibility, strengthening resilience, supporting communities, or enabling more informed and sustainable decision-making.; Project problem: Residents struggle to turn everyday civic problems into clear, actionable reports and to track whether a fix actually happened. Namma Civic connects accessible local reporting, community discussion, evidence-backed responses and citizen verification in one public record.) /ModDate (D:20261018212233+05'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
